		{
			dependencies: ["142264209DE37EC3"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E0A34A to=#FFE3B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>动物保护</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>当它存在于你的物品栏中时，你的攻击对动物无效，猪灵也不再具有敌意。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它还能缓和 </grad><grad from=#FF8A8A to=#E03131 f=0.8>第二诅咒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，使可驯服的动物保持中立，而不是加入敌对生物阵营。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>一本书、一个苹果、一朵蒲公英和金块。模组里最便宜的配方之一。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			id: "4194A6281F3AF5FE"
			min_width: 340
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#E0A34A to=#E0A34A>你根本不可能打到牛。</grad></typewriter>"
