			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#E0A34A to=#FFE3B8 f=0.6>动物伙伴指南</grad></shadow>"
			x: -4.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4194A6281F3AF5FE"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E0A34A to=#FFE3B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>伤害重定向</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的宠物在 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>24</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 格内受到的所有伤害都会转而由你来承受。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>同时携带《动物伙伴指南》，重定向的伤害将减少 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>50%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 没有另一本书，这对狼来说是一种非常有效的死法。"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "6BECDF798C694280"
			min_width: 340
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#E0A34A to=#E0A34A>你的宠物不再死亡。你开始了。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5855592C7CA99842"
