			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#E0A34A to=#FFE3B8 f=0.6>野性狩猎指南</grad></shadow>"
			x: -4.5d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4194A6281F3AF5FE"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E0A34A to=#FFE3B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>更宽阔的保护</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的攻击无法伤害动物，且周围的动物大多变为中立生物。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>中立动物不会主动发起攻击，即使受到 </grad><grad from=#FF8A8A to=#E03131 f=0.8>第二诅咒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的影响。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用这本书本身击中特定种类的动物，该物种将失去保护。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用它来让一切再次平静下来，冷却时间为 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>60秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>《动物伙伴指南》、一个地球之心、一个金苹果和一个附魔瓶。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "6289EAE60A0F0184"
			min_width: 340
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#E0A34A to=#E0A34A>动物之书，已升级。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
