			x: -4.5d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6BECDF798C694280"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E0A34A to=#FFE3B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>宠物获取你的属性</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"当宠物在背包中时，它们造成的伤害会提高25%。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>如果你也佩戴了</grad><grad from=#FF8A8A to=#E03131 f=0.8>血染荣耀徽章</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>或</grad><grad from=#FF8A8A to=#E03131 f=0.8>千咒卷轴</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，你的宠物也能获得与你相同的加成。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 一群继承了被诅咒玩家伤害倍数的狼，这简直荒谬。但这确实是个可行的策略。"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "0831FD7840512AAF"
			min_width: 340
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#E0A34A to=#E0A34A>你的狼会继承你的建造成果。</grad></typewriter>"
