			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E0A34A to=#FFE3B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>这是一个土豆</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>烤土豆、星尘和金块。它能恢复 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>8</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 饥饿值，并提供 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1.4</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 饱食度，它永远不会被烧毁，而且游戏坚持认为它是史诗稀有度。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>名字比物品本身承诺的要多得多，而这正是笑点所在。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
