		{
			dependencies: ["142264209DE37EC3"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E0A34A to=#FFE3B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>星味十足</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>效果持续时间比平时长 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1.6倍，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两次饮用之间有 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2分钟</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的冷却时间。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>物品本身的提示框警告你不要做得太过，而这在附加包里未必是玩笑话。</grad></shadow>"
			]
