			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#E0A34A to=#FFE3B8 f=0.6>Ichoroot</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["142264209DE37EC3"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E0A34A to=#FFE3B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>农场下界天空</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每击杀一个恶魂，都会先以 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>6%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的概率，再以 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>4%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的概率获得双倍掉落。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>净化之心、占卜卷轴、超维度权杖、流质长矛和雷霆拥抱卷轴所需。击杀大量恶魂。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			id: "6E84814D809363ED"
			min_width: 320
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#E0A34A to=#E0A34A>恶魂，只有恶魂。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
