			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["142264209DE37EC3"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E0A34A to=#FFE3B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>一个可以种植的老虎机</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它会随机生成一个属性和一个药水效果，消耗青金石可重掷。属性最高可达 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>16</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，效果最高可达 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>80</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>几乎没人用这个。它之所以存在，是因为它确实存在，而且偶尔用着挺好玩的。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			id: "3E3C94D9692DA75E"
			min_width: 330
			optional: true
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#E0A34A to=#E0A34A>喂它青金石，获得随机增益。</grad>"
